{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012wms8S2fb6GikMBXXy9Wto","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# foreman-checkpoint\n2\t\n3\t*Lane: build · validated, cached summary*\n4\t\n5\t**When run:** 2026-06-10\n6\t\n7\t**What was asked:** foreman-checkpoint\n8\t\n9\t## Actions & files produced\n10\t\n11\t- foreman-checkpoint\n12\t\n13\t**Effort:** imported — no run metrics\n14\t\n15\t## What was built & how it ran\n16\t\n17\t- **The checkpoint records a COMPLETE Foreman run.** `status: \"done\"`, `current_wave: 8` of `total_waves: 8`, `intra_wave_step: \"done\"` — the terminal wave is finished, not paused. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n18\t- **The run drove the ACTIVE harness handoff** — `plan_path` is `plans/foreman/t2r-harness-to-GA/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md` (the same handoff `foreman.config.json` points at). *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n19\t- **Final state is clean.** `last_verdict: \"GO\"`, `open_findings: []`, `pending_action: null`, `stash_ref: null` — no unresolved review findings and nothing staged for rollback. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n20\t- **Last commit of record is `ffbcffd6`**, which the execution log ties to Wave 8 (D3 Moving history breakpoint) at gate 154/154. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json` + `EXECUTION-LOG.md`)*\n21\t- **Every wave was gated by 2 independent adversarial reviewers** (`reviewer_count: 2`); a BLOCKER needs ≥2 reviewers to agree. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n22\t- **The terminal wave needed no fix loop** — `iteration: 0`, with `budget_remaining.fix_iters: 4` still available and `budget_remaining.waves: null` (uncapped). The run consumed 257.57 wall-clock minutes. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n23\t- **All 8 waves landed GREEN** *(`EXECUTION-LOG.md`)*: W1 land the held branch (`fcce2ed2`); W2 F5 cache-warmth data-gate (93/93, `dce2884f`); W3 cutover + soak (101/101, `be0076af`); W4 capability-gap audit + code-alpha (120/120, `00599167`); W5 research-alpha (123/123, `234b0fb0`); W6 D1 concurrent multi-agent harness (128/128, `fa0347bf`); W7 D2 write-tool fleet + supervisor + read_raw (146/146, `b2c3ccba`); W8 D3 moving history breakpoint (154/154, `ffbcffd6`).\n24\t- **The gate is orchestrator-run, not sub-agent-run** — `node --test gwl-t2r-brain/harness/*.test.mjs`; the test count ramped 93 → 154 across the run. *(`EXECUTION-LOG.md`)*\n25\t- **Outcome: the GWL harness is at GA** for the google+anthropic scope on the Opus-4.8 baseline brain. *(`EXECUTION-LOG.md`)*\n26\t- **A mid-run HALT was handled correctly, not bulldozed.** The run halted mid-Wave-7 when a reviewer sub-agent returned unparseable JSON twice and Foreman ABSTAINED rather than drop a possibly-real finding; W7 and W8 then completed under discipline (2/2 reviewers GO, no findings). *(`EXECUTION-LOG.md`)*\n27\t- **The rollback seam was preserved throughout** — every new capability is per-agent and default-OFF, with the wire byte-identical when disabled. *(`EXECUTION-LOG.md`)*\n28\t\n29\t## Files\n30\t\n31\t- [foreman-checkpoint](/artifact/fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c?path=foreman-checkpoint.json)\n32\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9a5e90a5-96d3-441c-af03-b2ae06d1ca43","uuid":"777058c3-9e7a-4cbc-8c29-53f590b35cbf","timestamp":"2026-06-23T21:19:55.568Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\Agentic-Home\\.anchor\\projects\\fe0a3e82a76347a19c91c365fd87787c\\build\\summaries\\build_fallback_fallback_0\\summary.md","content":"# foreman-checkpoint\n\n*Lane: build · validated, cached summary*\n\n**When run:** 2026-06-10\n\n**What was asked:** foreman-checkpoint\n\n## Actions & files produced\n\n- foreman-checkpoint\n\n**Effort:** imported — no run metrics\n\n## What was built & how it ran\n\n- **The checkpoint records a COMPLETE Foreman run.** `status: \"done\"`, `current_wave: 8` of `total_waves: 8`, `intra_wave_step: \"done\"` — the terminal wave is finished, not paused. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n- **The run drove the ACTIVE harness handoff** — `plan_path` is