{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Cx4tx9GMNEGYqbw9sLZA7c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## foreman-checkpoint — build trio session summary\n\nGrounded in `foreman-checkpoint.json` (repo root), `foreman.config.json`, and the cached build-lane summary (which cites `EXECUTION-LOG.md`):\n\n- **The checkpoint records a COMPLETE Foreman run, not a pause.** `status: \"done\"`, `current_wave: 8` of `total_waves: 8`, `intra_wave_step: \"done\"`. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n- **It drove the ACTIVE harness handoff** — `plan_path` → `plans/foreman/t2r-harness-to-GA/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md`, the same handoff `foreman.config.json` selects. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`, `foreman.config.json`)*\n- **Final state is clean.** `last_verdict: \"GO\"`, `open_findings: []`, `pending_action: null`, `stash_ref: null` — no unresolved findings, nothing staged for rollback. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n- **Last commit of record is `ffbcffd6`** (Wave 8, D3 moving-history-breakpoint) at test gate 154/154. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json` + log)*\n- **Every wave was gated by 2 independent adversarial reviewers** (`reviewer_count: 2`); a BLOCKER needs ≥2 to agree. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n- **The terminal wave needed no fix loop** — `iteration: 0`, `fix_iters: 4` still unspent, `waves` budget uncapped. Total run = **257.57 wall-clock minutes**. *(`foreman-checkpoint.json`)*\n- **All 8 waves landed GREEN**, test count ramping 93 → 154: W1 land branch (`fcce2ed2`); W2 F5 cache-warmth gate (93/93, `dce2884f`); W3 cutover+soak (101/101, `be0076af`); W4 capability audit + code-alpha (120/120, `00599167`); W5 research-alpha (123/123, `234b0fb0`); W6 D1 concurrent multi-agent (128/128, `fa0347bf`); W7 D2 write-tool fleet + supervisor + read_raw (146/146, `b2c3ccba`); W8 D3 moving history breakpoint (154/154, `ffbcffd6`). *(cached summary ← `EXECUTION-LOG.md`)*\n- **The gate is orchestrator-run, not sub-agent-run** — `node --test gwl-t2r-brain/harness/*.test.mjs`. *(log)*\n- **A mid-run HALT was handled with discipline, not bulldozed** — Foreman ABSTAINED mid-Wave-7 when a reviewer returned unparseable JSON twice rather than drop a possibly-real finding; W7/W8 then closed 2/2 GO. *(log)*\n- **The rollback seam held throughout** — every new capability is per-agent, default-OFF, wire-identical when disabled. *(log)*\n- **Outcome: the GWL harness is at GA** for the google+anthropic scope on the Opus-4.8 baseline brain. *(log)*\n\n**Caveat:** the cached build-lane summary is stamped \"imported — no run metrics\" and was generated 2026-06-10; I verified its claims against the current root `foreman-checkpoint.json`, which matches. Note a separate, divergent checkpoint exists at `plans/foreman/gwl-harness-orchestration/foreman-checkpoint.json` (Wave 1 of 6, `status: \"running\"`) — a *different* plan, not this session."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1280,"cache_read_input_tokens":60236,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1280},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9a5e90a5-96d3-441c-af03-b2ae06d1ca43","uuid":"7b868b15-27d4-48c3-858a-664a6fd91833","request_id":"req_011CcLtcDvaAV57vcAASV3dH"}
